PathOps Forgejo

This repository contains build tooling and a patch set for Forgejo
(https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo), which is licensed under the GNU General
Public License, version 3 or later. Forgejo source code is not vendored here;
it is fetched from the upstream release pinned in UPSTREAM_VERSION and
UPSTREAM_COMMIT.

The files under patches/ modify Forgejo. Each patch states the upstream files
it changes and why. Images built from this repository contain the modified
Forgejo built with the upstream rootless Dockerfile; their complete
corresponding source is the pinned upstream release plus these patches.

